#: ../../api/methods/get_chat_share_theme_backdrops.rst:3
msgid "getChatShareThemeBackdrops"
msgstr ""

#: litegram.methods.get_chat_share_theme_backdrops.GetChatShareThemeBackdrops:1
#: of
msgid ""
"Use this method to get the list of backdrops, which can be used as the "
"background of a theme of the screen for sharing a link to a user or a "
"chat. Requires no parameters. Returns a "
":class:`litegram.types.chat_share_theme_backdrops.ChatShareThemeBackdrops`"
" object."
msgstr ""
"Возвращает список фонов для темы экрана отправки ссылки на пользователя "
"или чат. Параметры не требуются. Возвращает объект "
":class:`litegram.types.chat_share_theme_backdrops.ChatShareThemeBackdrops`."

#: litegram.methods.get_chat_share_theme_backdrops.GetChatShareThemeBackdrops:3
#: of
